## CLI Surface

Implemented:

```text
retail-sim db migrate [--migrations-dir PATH]
retail-sim assortment build --date DATE          # S0, then S2
retail-sim assortment optimize (--store-id ID... | --all)   # sets flag to 1
retail-sim supply run --date DATE                # S0, then S1
retail-sim replenish run --date DATE             # S0, drop S3, S1, S2, S3
retail-sim sales run --date DATE                 # run_day: S0 … S4, then invariants
retail-sim simulate --from DATE --to DATE [--resume] [--no-journal]
retail-sim promo add --from DATE --to DATE --factor FACTOR (--store-id ID... | --all)
```

Still target:

```text
retail-sim web [--host HOST] [--port PORT]
retail-sim stores add N
```

Config via `DATABASE_URL`, `MIGRATIONS_DIR`, `SEED` (`.env`). Optimization flag `1` may also be set directly in `stores`.

